# child-fields — шаги записи (что показывается — child-fields.md)
# Этап 1 — умолчания; этап 2 заводит дочерний Value #review под #done и Child Field = After parent.
title Child Fields | A Field that is offered after its parent Value
# Каркас 2026-10-05: Scroller виден, в панели только нужные Fields, плашка у начала строки (tagWheel).
drop Due
drop Project
preset visual.tagWheel.scroller.enabled = true
open Child fields.md
line-width 480
caret - #done || call the bank
stage Status and Priority
say tagWheel has two Fields: Status and Priority
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowRight
key ArrowRight
key Escape
expect - #done || call the bank / - pay the rent

stage Child Field: After parent
settings Tags & PKM
spot Values
say Add #review under #done, Child Field → After parent
fill #tag / tag = review
click Add Value
click Make #review a child Value
set Child Field = After parent
caret - #done || call the bank
say After #done → its child Field offers #review
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowRight
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - #done #review || call the bank / - pay the rent

stage Child Field: Always
say Child Field → Always
settings Tags & PKM
set Child Field = Always
caret - pay the rent
say Always → the child is offered without a parent
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowRight
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - #done || call the bank / - #review || pay the rent
